        "eyebrow": "Choosing a service",
        "heading": "Virtual renovation service vs. AI virtual remodeling apps vs. a real remodel",
        "text": "There are several ways to show potential buyers a renovated home before the listing goes live. Here's how they differ on realism, turnaround time and cost."
